  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "principles-list",
   "x": 640,
   "y": 332,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 140,
   "text": "#0  Verify claims first -> read code / search docs\n#1  Start from existing context -> never invent\n#2  Reuse drawlib components -> never redraw\n#3  Junior Designer -> show skeleton first\n#4  Give variations -> never one answer\n#5  Placeholder > bad guess -> honest whitespace\n#6  System first -> every element earns its place\n#7  Anti-slop: <=4 colors, roughness<=1, grid-aligned",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
